UndergroundUnitsCh9:
UNIT Swift Scalemaster 0x0 Level(25,NPC,1) [5,5] 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0 [Juggernaut] NeverMoveAI
UNIT

//MESSAGE Events end at offset CURRENTOFFSET


ALIGN 4

LoadUndergroundUnits:
LoadUnitsByVisit(DummyUnits,DummyUnits,DummyUnits,DummyUnits,DummyUnits,UndergroundUnitsCh9,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0)
ENDA

LoadUndergroundSigils:
ENUF LocationFlagUnderground
AddSigil(4,1)
ENDA

UndergroundMoveToGrove:
SwapToMap(EmeraldGrove,10,5)
CALL LoadEmeraldGroveSigils
//eventual song
MUSC Song_EmeraldGrove
//CALL LoadEmeraldGroveUnits
FADU 10
EndEvent

